64659752124", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630198_2577186362552498_3913228803140222976_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1d4OCmh2HNsQ7kNvwHlJDaK&_nc_oc=AdogRByIEwSFmpnMEW3ZMy-JGns7iXGBurLaBu8s1_rDa-FHjfDUtdtyhroY7SBR3VE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFop4sI1NZh9iZzDIbQvT43PTA8HR1o22De4gzwQHzBWQ&oe=6A707FDD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "561784124443343", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458099_2270787786557926_9182956901405556736_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k9sefZFhvAcQ7kNvwFW99cp&_nc_oc=Adq_iBjFd_TX800mHKCZ2SOUEMx3g5AjAUCH2bOqi5jr5yqL6ScmX9n7SOKfwvwvRw8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRGpDeXBzk3Rs0Fe2d7SiKq-Q7ZOGt0KDULsYplcT2qg&oe=6A708937"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "224781318713799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_523290235257100_254597187336404992_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zwpAbZvVZCgQ7kNvwHOfEEY&_nc_oc=Adp2U4I3Aazk6PoCxli-O5C-TcN4G8p7PigeikGWH7wUmh8M88tDKHsC2Z55XLI8_0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFzP1gT8-q-doDxj6ouPRn8HkBX0L8Dq2ImsNr7h19Ceg&oe=6A7076D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster - Epic Bat Shooting Game", "keywords": ["Epic", "Roller", "Coaster", "Shooting", "Game"], "long_description": "Ready to experience the real adventure of Epic Roller Coaster with a new feature of bat shooting? Indulge in one of the most refined, immersive and energetic VR coasters you\u2019ve ever seen!\nIf you don\u2019t want to go for a most spooky adventure, then you can also enjoy the peaceful ride of Fantasy Roller Coaster! \nThere are 3 modes to have the fun of Epic Roller Coaster:\n1.\tSimple Peaceful Ride\n2.\tHaving Controls on Speed \n3.\tBat Shooting Mode\n\nIf you have any feedback, feel free to share. More and long